# Spec 103 AC5 — SHA-256 of every [ops."…"] table the route table sends to the hosted server (with its .input), and of [snippets]. Canonical form: compact JSON, keys sorted.
# First recorded at main 2e57112f (version 1.91.179), before the hosted server became an https server.
# Re-recorded at 1.91.191, a DELIBERATE change: AWS's sandbox now refuses `import base64`, `getattr()` and `__name__`, so the prelude
# carries its own base64 and AwsMcp.AwsCall reads an error without either — [snippets], AwsMcp.AwsCall, AwsPolly.Synthesize,
# AwsS3.GetObject and AwsS3.PutObject changed; the other 29 are byte-identical to 1.91.179.
